  "result": "`String.prototype.localeCompare` is implemented in `crates/kahvi-builtins/src/string/prototype_locale_compare.rs`, the only file changed. `./t262 built-ins/String/prototype/localeCompare/` passes 26/26 runs, clippy and `cargo fmt --check` are clean.\n\nThe comparison is by UTF-16 code units of each string's NFC form, so canonically equivalent strings return `+0` and the ordering is total. The two private helpers (`to_code_points` and `from_code_points`) duplicate ones in `string/prototype_normalize.rs`; a shared helper would be a follow-up, since I was told not to edit other files.",
